{"id":3099,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2026年5月16日16:00，计算机科学与技术学院学生会文体部于11105H教室成功举办经典诗词竞技大赛。本次活动以“诗韵芳华，文脉流长”为主题，旨在弘扬中华优秀传统文化，丰富校园文化生活，以诗词浸润心灵，以经典涵养正气，助力学子在书香氛围中提升人文素养、坚定文化自信。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=0L4Va2U4n2LN74nP7nfM4C8oz-bU4fYRM7MfMl-aLlV2M4-0gihFp2hmCIa0Mkh2n1hkLYybUNrRU4f7nzLsUzV2ollPnz-8nRnknRnRnRrFMzvYMlLsMNMFMz-8nRUJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0Lz7ZMmLJqd4nx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11863&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/4FFB39BECC0DE37A1F9E1E24D4BD4CD5/5725C76C/524D4\" vheight=\" 474px\" vwidth=\" 592px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=0L4Va2U4n2LN74nP7nfM4C8oz-bU4fYRM7MfMl-aLlV2M4-0gihFp2hmCIa0Mkh2n1hkLYybUNrRU4f7nzLsUzV2ollPnz-8nRnknRnRnRrFMzvYMlLsMNMFMz-8nRUJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0Lz7ZMmLJqd4nx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11863&e=.png\"></p><p>&nbsp; 大赛面向学院全体在校学生招募，经前期报名与资格审核，众多诗词爱好者齐聚赛场、以诗会友。比赛设置固定必答题、抢答题、飞花令、观众互动答题四大环节，层层递进、紧张有序，全面考验选手诗词储备、临场反应与综合素养。</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;竞赛主要分为必答题与抢答题两大环节。必答题环节中，选手们沉着冷静，认真审题作答，稳定发挥自身实力，展现出严谨认真的态度。抢答题环节摒弃繁琐规则，以快速举手抢答的形式开展，考验选手的反应速度与知识熟练度，大家争分夺秒、踊跃抢答，现场互动感十足，节奏紧凑有趣，充分调动了全场氛围。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=0o7UaYnzQkozNZLPR-YMN-DM7LiLz9YDUzCPLmC4LRGYL870gihFp2hmCIa0USyboSyYL1yiLllDLRLbL4U4Mm7DnmL4LlnRoR-sLmGsUmTFM4NPUz-snRWFMzn2L4GJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0Lz7ZMmLJqd4nx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11863&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/A992251E6039343616F331DC827207B9/791A27D2/54F30\" vheight=\" 474px\" vwidth=\" 596px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=0o7UaYnzQkozNZLPR-YMN-DM7LiLz9YDUzCPLmC4LRGYL870gihFp2hmCIa0USyboSyYL1yiLllDLRLbL4U4Mm7DnmL4LlnRoR-sLmGsUmTFM4NPUz-snRWFMzn2L4GJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0Lz7ZMmLJqd4nx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11863&e=.png\"></p><p>&nbsp; 最具看点的飞花令环节，现场随机抽取“月、风、花、山”等关键字，选手们按序轮流作答，一句句含指定关键字的经典诗句脱口而出。大家不重复、不卡顿、不超时，你来我往、字字珠玑，将千年诗韵展现得淋漓尽致，角逐激烈又不失风雅。</p><p>&nbsp; 比赛间隙设置观众互动答题环节，10道经典诗词题引得全场踊跃举手，答对即可获得精美文创书签，充分调动现场氛围，让全体同学共享诗词之乐。</p><p>&nbsp; 经过多轮激烈角逐，评委团公平公正评审，工作人员严谨计分核对，最终评选出竞赛获奖名单分别为：一等奖：张家源；二等奖：曲保同、崔峻旗；三等奖：魏正豪、杨江博、黄旭敏。最终为获奖选手颁发荣誉证书与奖品，全体选手、工作人员与嘉宾合影留念，镜头定格下书香满溢的荣耀时刻 。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=0UmNasLRG8LmVVMPmlsn7L4LmNsUzTY2LlQfMzQVn7QkUNL0gihFp2hmCIa0n1hVMYyDUYyiMNnRnm7aLml4M8-boR9iM4Q2M8MVUmARnmfFn7lDnzN4U8MFMRU8Lz-Jv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0Lz7ZMmLJqd4nx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11863&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/FE76C56DCF102537B988576F7CEB8CF0/DE6E93CC/44412\" vheight=\" 474px\" vwidth=\" 602px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=0UmNasLRG8LmVVMPmlsn7L4LmNsUzTY2LlQfMzQVn7QkUNL0gihFp2hmCIa0n1hVMYyDUYyiMNnRnm7aLml4M8-boR9iM4Q2M8MVUmARnmfFn7lDnzN4U8MFMRU8Lz-Jv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0Lz7ZMmLJqd4nx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11863&e=.png\"><br></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=0M4nafMz98Ll-YMPR7Dnz9DozU4UzGYsM7lDLm9bUNCbL7L0gihFp2hmCIa0nkh7M1hRnkhRU8UbMz62L4LiUlrRLz7YUzNsLRAkL7lDMmVFnNr7MR9DMRTFMRWfLllJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0Lz7ZMmLJqd4nx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11863&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/DD6CDCCD957F335AEC112A9708B0E661/FED48649/42A1E\" vheight=\" 474px\" vwidth=\" 604px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=0M4nafMz98Ll-YMPR7Dnz9DozU4UzGYsM7lDLm9bUNCbL7L0gihFp2hmCIa0nkh7M1hRnkhRU8UbMz62L4LiUlrRLz7YUzNsLRAkL7lDMmVFnNr7MR9DMRTFMRWfLllJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0Lz7ZMmLJqd4nx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11863&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=0ozWaVnRvZL8lDLPlL4ollDoRCbLNUY4LmlZU4CZozMfL4U0gihFp2hmCIa0U1yin1hVLkyiU8VRU4QVL4NsMR-aolVfUzAkMzffLRQfM8VFLzLsLm7DM4AFL8CsUNlJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0Lz7ZMmLJqd4nx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11863&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/B5FE05CACC6E3974209AAA8B50A06A7A/13721678/3F7BE\" vheight=\" 474px\" vwidth=\" 607px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=0ozWaVnRvZL8lDLPlL4ollDoRCbLNUY4LmlZU4CZozMfL4U0gihFp2hmCIa0U1yin1hVLkyiU8VRU4QVL4NsMR-aolVfUzAkMzffLRQfM8VFLzLsLm7DM4AFL8CsUNlJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0Lz7ZMmLJqd4nx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11863&e=.png\"></p><p>&nbsp; 此次经典诗词竞技大赛，不仅为同学们提供了展示诗词才华的舞台，更让大家在竞技中感受中华经典的魅力，在诵读中传承千年文脉。未来，计算机科学与技术学院将继续开展更多优质文化活动，以文育人、以美润心，让传统文化在校园落地生根，让书香伴随学子成长。&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=0nmnafUm7Ynm9aoPlMknRf7M4L4L8lYaMlr7olVfU4GsUNL0gihFp2hmCIa0oSyaLShVnShVnlM7o7LsLz6RMRLsnNl4U4QVLzLaU8QRL4MFo7U4L4GDLRfFM7Uan7LJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0Lz7ZMmLJqd4nx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11863&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/901EEEECD8C717C437FE3C6E130CFC33/8D330600/4D0DC\" vheight=\" 474px\" vwidth=\" 611px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=0nmnafUm7Ynm9aoPlMknRf7M4L4L8lYaMlr7olVfU4GsUNL0gihFp2hmCIa0oSyaLShVnShVnlM7o7LsLz6RMRLsnNl4U4QVLzLaU8QRL4MFo7U4L4GDLRfFM7Uan7LJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0Lz7ZMmLJqd4nx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11863&e=.png\"></p><p></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;计算机科学与技术学院 宣</p></div><BR><BR></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://cst.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=0L4Va2U4n2LN74nP7nfM4C8oz-bU4fYRM7MfMl-aLlV2M4-0gihFp2hmCIa0Mkh2n1hkLYybUNrRU4f7nzLsUzV2ollPnz-8nRnknRnRnRrFMzvYMlLsMNMFMz-8nRUJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0Lz7ZMmLJqd4nx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11863&e=.png"}